\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Hybrid-AR1 decomposition on Las Vegas 2017. The IHP term collapses to a near-delta spike that absorbs the day-0 burst (initial amplitude $A\approx 487$, $\beta _0=2.22 \Rightarrow $ half-life $0.31$ days), and the self-excitation term ($n=0.7248$) carries the subsequent endogenous dynamics.}}{8}{figure.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:partA-hybrid-decomp}{{3}{8}{Hybrid-AR1 decomposition on Las Vegas 2017. The IHP term collapses to a near-delta spike that absorbs the day-0 burst (initial amplitude $A\approx 487$, $\beta _0=2.22 \Rightarrow $ half-life $0.31$ days), and the self-excitation term ($n=0.7248$) carries the subsequent endogenous dynamics}{figure.caption.26}{}}
