\newlabel{fig:partB-meanfield}{{8}{12}{Mean-field Markov on Las Vegas 2017: fitted logistic links $P_{\mathrm {neg}\to \mathrm {pos}}(\pipos )$ and $P_{\mathrm {pos}\to \mathrm {neg}}(\pipos )$, plus the resulting time trajectory of the implied transition matrix entries}{figure.caption.38}{}}
